  'You can update your language and learning preferences. School, class and teacher details are managed by authorised school staff.': ['O ka ntšhwafatsa puo le ditlhopho tsa gago tsa go ithuta. Badiri ba sekolo ba ba nang le tetla ba tlhokomela dintlha tsa sekolo, phaposi le morutabana.', 'Ungabuyekeza ulimi nezintandokazi zakho zokufunda. Abasebenzi besikole abagunyaziwe baphethe imininingwane yesikole, yekilasi neyothisha.', 'Ungahlaziya ulwimi nezinto ozikhethayo ekufundeni. Abasebenzi besikolo abagunyazisiweyo balawula iinkcukacha zesikolo, zeklasi nezikatitshala.'],
  'Update preferences': ['Ntšhwafatsa ditlhopho', 'Buyekeza izintandokazi', 'Hlaziya izinto ozikhethayo'],

  'This lesson is not ready in {language} yet. We are showing it in English while a person checks the translation.': ['Thuto eno ga e ise e nne teng ka {language}. Re bontsha Seesemane fa phetolelo e ntse e sekasekwa.', 'Lesi sifundo asikakalungeli ngesi-{language}. Sisibonisa ngesiNgisi ngesikhathi umuntu ehlola ukuhumusha.', 'Esi sifundo asikakulungeli ngesi-{language}. Sisibonisa ngesiNgesi ngoxa umntu ejonga inguqulelo.'],
  'This lesson uses a locally provided {language} translation.': ['Thuto eno e dirisa phetolelo ya {language} e e baakantsweng fano.', 'Lesi sifundo sisebenzisa ukuhumusha kwesi-{language} okulungiselelwe lapha.', 'Esi sifundo sisebenzisa inguqulelo yesi-{language} elungiselelwe apha.'],
  'This lesson’s {language} translation was checked by a reviewer.': ['Phetolelo ya thuto eno ya {language} e sekasekilwe ke motlhatlhobi.', 'Ukuhumusha kwalesi sifundo ngesi-{language} kuhlolwe umbuyekezi.', 'Inguqulelo yesi sifundo yesi-{language} ijongwe ngumhloli.'],
  'The lesson title and objective were written by your teacher and stay in their original language.': ['Morutabana wa gago o kwadile setlhogo le maitlhomo a thuto ka puo ya gagwe.', 'Isihloko nomgomo wesifundo kubhalwe uthisha wakho ngolimi lwakhe.', 'Isihloko nenjongo yesifundo zibhalwe ngutitshala wakho ngolwimi lwakhe.'],
  'Let’s learn about': ['A re ithuteng ka', 'Masifunde ngo-', 'Masifunde nge-'],
  'Today we learn about': ['Gompieno re ithuta ka', 'Namuhla sifunda ngo-', 'Namhlanje sifunda nge-'],
  'Think of where you see {topic} at home or on the way to school.': ['Akanya gore o bona {topic} kae kwa gae kgotsa fa o ya sekolong.', 'Cabanga ngokuthi ubona kuphi {topic} ekhaya noma endleleni eya esikoleni.', 'Cinga ngendawo obona kuyo {topic} ekhaya okanye endleleni eya esikolweni.'],
  'With a buddy, find two things in the classroom that show {topic}. Draw them in your book.': ['Le tsala, batla dilo tse pedi mo phaposing tse di bontshang {topic}. Di thale mo bukeng ya gago.', 'Nomngani, thola izinto ezimbili ekilasini ezibonisa u-{topic}. Zidwebe encwadini yakho.', 'Nomhlobo, fumana izinto ezimbini eklasini ezibonisa i-{topic}. Zizobe encwadini yakho.'],

  'A fraction is a part of a whole.': ['Karolwana ke karolo ya selo sotlhe.', 'Ingxenyana iyingxenye yento ephelele.', 'Iqhezu yinxalenye yento epheleleyo.'],
  'Sharing fairly: halves and quarters': ['Go arogana ka tekatekano: dihalofo le dikotara', 'Ukwabelana ngokulinganayo: amahhafu namakota', 'Ukwabelana ngokulinganayo: iziqingatha neekota'],
  'Cut a bread into 4 equal parts.': ['Kgaoganya senkgwe ka dikarolo tse 4 tse di lekanang.', 'Sika isinkwa sibe izingxenye ezi-4 ezilinganayo.', 'Sika isonka sibe ziinxalenye ezi-4 ezilinganayo.'],
  'One part is one quarter. We write 1/4.': ['Karolo e le nngwe ke kotara. Re kwala 1/4.', 'Ingxenye eyodwa iyikota. Sibhala u-1/4.', 'Inxalenye enye yikota. Sibhala u-1/4.'],
  'When you share an orange equally with a friend, you each get 1/2.': ['Fa wena le tsala ya gago lo arogana namune ka go lekana, mongwe le mongwe o bona halofo (1/2).', 'Uma wabelana nomngani ngowolintshi ngokulinganayo, ngamunye uthola uhhafu (1/2).', 'Xa wabelana nge-orenji nomhlobo ngokulinganayo, ngamnye ufumana isiqingatha (1/2).'],
  'Fold a piece of scrap paper into 4 equal parts. Colour 1 part. You made 1/4!': ['Mena pampiri e e sa dirisiweng ka dikarolo tse 4 tse di lekanang. Khalara karolo e le 1. O dirile 1/4!', 'Goqa iphepha elilahliwe libe izingxenye ezi-4 ezilinganayo. Faka umbala engxenyeni e-1. Usenze u-1/4!', 'Songa iphepha elingasetyenziswayo libe ziinxalenye ezi-4 ezilinganayo. Faka umbala kwinxalenye e-1. Wenze u-1/4!'],
  'Which picture shows 1/4?': ['Ke setshwantsho sefe se se bontshang 1/4?', 'Isiphi isithombe esibonisa u-1/4?', 'Ngowuphi umfanekiso obonisa u-1/4?'],
  'Count the shaded parts. Then count all the parts.': ['Bala dikarolo tse di khalarilweng. Jaanong bala dikarolo tsotlhe.', 'Bala izingxenye ezinemibala. Bese ubala zonke izingxenye.', 'Bala iinxalenye ezinemibala. Emva koko bala zonke iinxalenye.'],
  'Which picture shows 1/2?': ['Ke setshwantsho sefe se se bontshang 1/2?', 'Isiphi isithombe esibonisa u-1/2?', 'Ngowuphi umfanekiso obonisa u-1/2?'],
  'Half means 2 equal parts.': ['Halofo e raya dikarolo tse 2 tse di lekanang.', 'Uhhafu usho izingxenye ezi-2 ezilinganayo.', 'Isiqingatha sithetha iinxalenye ezi-2 ezilinganayo.'],
  'Two friends share 1 bread equally. What does each friend get?': ['Ditsala tse pedi di arogana senkgwe se le 1 ka go lekana. Nngwe le nngwe e bona eng?', 'Abangani ababili babelana ngesinkwa esi-1 ngokulinganayo. Umngani ngamunye uthola ini?', 'Abahlobo ababini babelana ngesonka esi-1 ngokulinganayo. Umhlobo ngamnye ufumana ntoni?'],
  'There are 2 friends, so cut the bread into 2 equal parts.': ['Go na le ditsala tse 2, ka jalo kgaoganya senkgwe ka dikarolo tse 2 tse di lekanang.', 'Kunabangani aba-2, ngakho sika isinkwa sibe izingxenye ezi-2 ezilinganayo.', 'Kukho abahlobo aba-2, ngoko sika isonka sibe ziinxalenye ezi-2 ezilinganayo.'],
  'Let learners show their folded paper before they write the fraction.': ['Letla barutwana ba bontshe pampiri e ba e menetseng pele ba kwala karolwana.', 'Cela abafundi babonise iphepha abaligoqile ngaphambi kokubhala ingxenyana.', 'Cela abafundi babonise iphepha abalisongeleyo ngaphambi kokubhala iqhezu.'],
  'Take it one small step at a time.': ['Dira kgato e nnye e nnye.', 'Kwenze isinyathelo esisodwa ngesikhathi.', 'Yenza inyathelo elinye ngexesha.'],
  'Use your hands to show it.': ['Dirisa diatla go e bontsha.', 'Sebenzisa izandla zakho ukuyibonisa.', 'Sebenzisa izandla zakho ukuyibonisa.'],
  'Draw a picture to show it.': ['Thala setshwantsho go e bontsha.', 'Dweba isithombe ukuyibonisa.', 'Zoba umfanekiso ukuyibonisa.'],
  'Look at the example on the board.': ['Leba sekai se se mo letlapeng.', 'Bheka isibonelo esisebhodini.', 'Jonga umzekelo osebhodini.'],
  'Then try one with a friend.': ['Morago o leke se sengwe le tsala.', 'Bese uzama esinye nomngani.', 'Emva koko zama esinye nomhlobo.'],
