    'Fold a piece of scrap paper into 4 equal parts. Colour 1 part. You made 1/4!': 'Peta bammbiri ḽi si tsha shumiswa ḽi vhe zwipiḓa zwiṋa zwi eḓanaho. Penndani tshipiḓa tshithihi. No ita 1/4!',
